        },
        "publishTime": "2026-09-10T03:51:53.004899089Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SclYySXdWa3hzVUc5Q1dUSkdWRWh2UW5sblVIYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SclYySXdWa3hzVUc5Q1dUSkdWRWh2UW5sblVIYxAB!2m1!1s0x34040053f4711c2d:0x637bb6b986f1f556"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJLRxx9FMABDQRVvXxhrm2e2M/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kUFUzSjNhalJGUmtnNExWWnRRbVZDVGtReVprRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "最近發現灣仔有間幾有氣氛嘅Cafe，環境chill，啱曬坐低慢慢食個Brunch。\n\n餐廳走現代工業風設計，整體環境幾chill，仲設有室外座位，可以望住電車路，一邊飲咖啡一邊睇住電車經過，好有香港特色\n\n點咗一份藜麥沙律坐低慢慢慢慢嘆☺️\n配料超豐富，feta cheese、溏心蛋、牛油果、青瓜同羅馬生菜，整體配搭清新健康。藜麥口感帶少少嚼勁，配上牛油果嘅creamy口感同feta cheese嘅鹹香，好夾，我另外加咗 烤雞肉，雞肉烤得外層微微焦香，肉質嫩滑，令整份沙律更加有飽足感。\n整體食物感覺清爽又唔會太heavy，幾適合Brunch或者輕食Lunch。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
